obs Without rg on PATH the portable-helper control passed 45 checks and skipped the two checks in one optional branch. shell_dialect requires all 47. Installed Ripgrep 15.1.0 was found in the Nix store; adding its bin directory to this pass's PATH produced 47 passes, zero skips and zero failures. The complete shell_dialect witness passed. No host configuration was changed.
